{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Drummer: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja59'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 59 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Āsīsavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Hope </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>9. Bherivādakajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Drummer: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Dhame dhame nātidhame, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Blow, blow, don’t overblow, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>atidhantañhi pāpakaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>for overblowing is bad. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Dhantena hi sataṁ laddhaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>By blowing a hundred was gained, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>atidhantena nāsitan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>by overblowing it was lost. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Bherivādakajātakaṁ navamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
